+/*
+ * Exact private mirrors of the userspace ABI in CIX's p1_v2.0.0 release
+ * (commit 25b55cc08ec735093b5808c7cd0723f1a128c645).  The imported driver
+ * engine uses later, incompatible structures with the same schedule ioctl
+ * number and size, so never copy a P1 request directly into those types.
